# The Akroan War's III: each tapped creature deals damage to itself equal to its power, as its own source (CR 120.3).
# Bot2's Vampire Nighthawk (2/3, deathtouch, lifelink), tapped from the attack II forced on T4, deals 2 to itself: its own
# deathtouch destroys it (CR 702.2b) and its own lifelink gains Bot2 2 (CR 120.3f) - 2, its power, not 3, its toughness.
# Bot1's Llanowar Elves, tapped for mana with III on the stack and given -4/-0 by Depower, has power -3 and deals no
# damage (CR 107.1b, 120.8), so it survives. Chapter I had no creature to target when the Saga entered on T1.

